<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>기상청 날씨 대시보드</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI';
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

.container {
    margin-top: 100px;
}

.card {
    margin: auto;
    padding: 30px;
    width: 300px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
}

.temp {
    font-size: 50px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>🌤 기상청 날씨</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="temp">{{ temp }}°C</div>
        <p>{{ sky }}</p>
        <p>{{ rain }}</p>

        {% if temp|int < 10 %}
            <p>🧥 두꺼운 옷 필수</p>
        {% elif temp|int < 20 %}
            <p>🧢 가벼운 외투 추천</p>
        {% else %}
            <p>👕 반팔 OK</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
